url: https://manga.nicovideo.jp/comic/56012
why: 'ささやくように恋を唄う, in ニコニコ百合姫, whose slug is nico-yurihime. A slug pattern of

  [a-z0-9_]+ stops at the hyphen and would have filed the 28 works in that channel
  under one called

  nico, which is not a channel at all. No other channel spelling on this platform
  shows that, so this

  page is held for the hyphen. Cut to the two blocks the channel question turns on,
  which is why it

  agrees with channel and not with parse.'
